OL,3,GNEWSAVineyard's earliest ever harvest
OL,4,Aafter extreme heat
OL,5,
OL,6,FA record-breaking summer has prompted
OL,7,Fan English wine producer to begin
OL,8,Fharvesting grapes earlier than ever
OL,9,Fbefore.
OL,11,FNyetimber's staff have had to contend
OL,12,Fwith extreme weather conditions from
OL,13,Flate frosts to drought.
OL,15,FThe scorching weather means picking is
OL,16,Fdue to begin at its West Chiltington
OL,17,Fand Amberley vineyards on Monday 14
OL,18,FSeptember - five days earlier than its
OL,19,Fprevious earliest harvest on 19
OL,20,FSeptember 2018.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
