OL,3,GNEWSAVineyard's earliest ever harvest
OL,4,Aafter extreme heat
OL,5,
OL,6,FAround 500 pickers will then descend on
OL,7,Fits 11 vineyards across Kent including
OL,8,Fnear Maidstone, West Sussex and
OL,9,FHampshire from 21 September.
